# ============================================
# ARTH — Environment Variables
# ============================================
# Copy to .env.local:   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# Nothing here is required to boot the site. Every integration is optional and
# self-disables when its env vars are absent. Full table with real values and
# the security notes: docs/DEPLOYMENT.md §1. To add an integration:
#
#   • Scaffold env vars:   bun run setup:project
#   • Full list + types:   lib/env.ts          (Zod-validated source of truth)
#   • Per-integration:     lib/integrations/<name>/README.md
#                          (sanity · shopify · hubspot · mailchimp)
# ============================================

# Public site URL — SEO, canonical URLs, OG images, sitemap, robots.
# dev: http://localhost:3000   ·   prod: https://your-domain.com
# On Vercel it may stay unset: the site then uses the project's production
# domain (lib/base-url.ts). Set it for a custom domain, or on any other host.
NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_URL="http://localhost:3000"

# Hosts that may be indexed, comma-separated. LEAVE UNSET while the site still
# serves placeholder content: unset means every response carries
# `X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow` and every page a meta robots tag, which is
# what keeps unfinished copy out of search results and out of AI answer
# engines. The final domain goes here when real content ships, and nothing
# else does — a host listed here is a host someone vouched for.
# Reasoning: lib/seo/robots-policy.ts
# INDEXABLE_HOSTS="arth.your-domain.com"

# Storybook proxy (optional, Preview only). When set, /storybook on this domain
# proxies to your standalone Storybook deployment (build it with
# `bun run build-storybook`, output `storybook-static`). Leave UNSET in
# Production — the route is force-disabled there regardless. For local dev, run
# `bun storybook` and use http://localhost:6006 directly.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_STORYBOOK_URL="https://your-storybook.vercel.app"
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_PROJECT_ID=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_DATASET=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_API_VERSION=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_API_READ_TOKEN=
# SANITY_API_READ_TOKEN=
# SANITY_PRIVATE_TOKEN=
# SANITY_API_WRITE_TOKEN=
# SANITY_STUDIO_PROJECT_ID=
# SANITY_REVALIDATE_SECRET=
